cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Probabilistic Demand Forecasting: Time-Series Foundation Models vs. Strong Baselines"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of zero-shot time-series foundation models against classical baselines on the M5
  retail demand data, scored on point accuracy (MASE) and on the calibration of probabilistic forecasts
  (scaled quantile loss, prediction interval coverage).
authors:
